## Scope note

The text above covers **this repository's own source** - everything under
`Source/`, `tests/`, `cmake/`, `docs/` and the build files at the root.

It does **not** cover what the build links against, and those terms are stricter
than MIT in places. What you have to know before shipping a binary:

- **JUCE 9.0.4** is a git submodule at `JUCE/` and is licensed under the
  **AGPLv3** or a commercial JUCE licence - see
  <https://juce.com/legal/juce-9-licence/>. A plugin that links JUCE is
  distributed under one of those two, never under the MIT text above.
- **`chowdsp_dsp_utils`** (a module of `chowdsp_utils`) is **GPLv3** and is
  **not linked** - it was the one library on the link line with no caller, and
  WP1 of `docs/library-integration-plan.md` removed it. `chowdsp_math` and
  `chowdsp_simd`, which the plugin does link, are BSD.
- **`Eigen`** (vendored, linked by default through `J37_NAMCORE`; `-DJ37_NAMCORE=OFF`
  drops it) is **MPL-2.0** - file-level copyleft, not the permissive terms above. Its own files stay under
  MPL-2.0 and this repository does not modify them; linking it does not place
  the rest of the binary under MPL. The complete corresponding source is the
  vendored tree at `ThirdParty/eigen/`. **NeuralAmpModelerCore** (also
  `J37_NAMCORE`) is MIT.
- **SoundTouch 2.4.1** (LGPL-2.1) is **not** part of this tree any more: it was
  linked by nothing and has been removed under WP4 of
  `docs/library-integration-plan.md`. **libsndfile** (LGPL-2.1) is fetched by
  CMake and **not linked**, so no binary built from this tree contains it.
- **`rack_dsp`** comes from VCVRack/Rack, which is GPL-3.0-or-later with a
  plugin exception for plugins distributed free of charge.

`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` lists each component, its pin and its licence, and
`README.md` section
[Licensing, and what ships in a binary](README.md#licensing-and-what-ships-in-a-binary)
explains what that means for a distributed build. Check both before you publish
anything built from this tree.
